{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "補"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔頌〕馬祖因僧問「離四句、絕百非」話"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔又〕僧問雲門：「久雨不晴時如何？」曰：「劄。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔又〕良遂參麻谷因緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔又〕熏風自南來，殿閣生微凉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔上堂〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔又〕"}
