{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔頌〕楊岐問僧：「栗棘蓬，你作麼生吞？金剛圈，你作麼生跳？」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則考補"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔上堂〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔又〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔僧問〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則考妙慧弘智禪師廷俊撰\n〈無印證行狀〉補。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔附錄〕元叟端禪師，雲外和尚遺書至，上堂。"}
